<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f5;
      padding: 40px;
      color: #333;
    "
  >
    <div
      style="
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      "
    >
      <!-- Header -->
      <div style="background-color: #004174; padding: 28px 32px; text-align: center">
        <img 
          src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/o/laigusbucket%2FC2C.png?alt=media&token=2c05d23e-1974-4a83-8143-99c1b6b96801" 
          alt="CVtoCAREER Logo" 
          style="display: block; margin: 0 auto 16px auto; width: 149px; height: 32px"
        />
        <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #fff; font-size: 22px">
          New OTP Token
        </h1>
      </div>

      <!-- Body -->
      <div class="body-content">
        <b>Dear Admin,</b>

        <p>
          User, <strong><%= name %></strong> with email,
          <strong><%= email %></strong> has received a new verification token.
        </p>

        <p>Please take note of this new registration activity.</p>

        <p>
          Details: <br />Name: <strong><%= name %></strong> <br />
          Email: <strong><%= email %></strong>. <br />
          They've been sent a verification token to confirm their email within
          10 minutes.
        </p>

        <div class="signature">
          <p>Best regards,<br />CVtoCAREER</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div
        style="
          padding: 16px 32px;
          background-color: #f9fafb;
          border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
          text-align: center;
        "
      >
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af">
          © <%= currentYear %> CVtoCAREER. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
